{"product_id":"stories-of-magic-ponies-young-reading-series-1-3-1-young-reading-series-one-red","title":"Stories of Magic Ponies (Young Reading (Series 1)) (3.1 Young Reading Series One (Red))","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis is a new title in \"Usborne Young Reading Series One\". It feature three original stories set on the magical Pony Island, where rainbow-coloured, talking ponies get up to all kinds of mischief and adventure! It offers desirable and collectable editions to foster pride in book ownership as well as reading enjoyment. The \"Young Reading Series One\" is aimed at children just beginning to read to help build confidence and ability. It is developed in consultation with Alison Kelly, who is a senior lecturer in education and an early reading specialist from Roehampton University.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 136 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Susanna Davidson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780746078365\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738309976217,"sku":"15RE-49780746078365","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ca9eb13b945_Stories_of_Magic_Ponies__Young_Reading__Series_1___3.1_Young_Reading_Series_One__Red__Susanna_Davidson.jpg?v=1758563447","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/stories-of-magic-ponies-young-reading-series-1-3-1-young-reading-series-one-red","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}